
## 🚀 Deployment Commands

```bash
# Initialize Cyber Shield Repository
git init
git add .
git commit -m "🛡️ SAFEWAY GUARDIAN v1.0.0 - SG QUANTUM CYBER SHIELD with Elemental Defense"

# Create and push to GitHub
gh repo create sg-quantum-cyber-shield --public --description "Quantum Cybersecurity Shield with Five Elements Defense"
